  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lead researchers on study into funding levels to local actors in east Africa hunger reponse</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This policy brief (approx. 20 pages) will analyse the funding landscape for local and national actors (LNAs) responding to the food and hunger crises in Kenya and South Sudan. It will follow up a 2023 report commissioned by CAFOD and will consider any meaningful changes or developments in the past year. 

The objective of this brief is to inform policy engagement and advocacy by Charter4Change members, CAFOD, and LNAs. Evidence, analysis, and recommendations from this brief can be used to influence donors, UN agencies, and INGOs to better support local leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
